{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00144",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 1.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 2.78,
      "end_seconds": 6.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 7.73,
      "end_seconds": 17.54,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps. Doctor, it's been feeling cold all the time. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.84,
      "end_seconds": 22.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "So, I've been putting on weight too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.75,
      "end_seconds": 30.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any heavy periods, hair loss, swelling in the neck or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.29,
      "end_seconds": 37.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Well, no heavy periods, hair loss, swelling in the neck or palpitations, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.33,
      "end_seconds": 41.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.9,
      "end_seconds": 44.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.35,
      "end_seconds": 47.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.7,
      "end_seconds": 69.73,
      "duration_seconds": 17.03,
      "text": "Uh, uh, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.74,
      "end_seconds": 74.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.54,
      "end_seconds": 78.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "So, my sister has thyroid problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.03,
      "end_seconds": 81.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.34,
      "end_seconds": 88.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.63,
      "end_seconds": 94.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 94.9,
      "end_seconds": 107.08,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "She is on iron tablets, once a day for my blood count, I give it to her. Oh, uh, she takes ramipril, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.11,
      "end_seconds": 109.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 110.18,
      "end_seconds": 111.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "It's 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.74,
      "end_seconds": 125.1,
      "duration_seconds": 13.36,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.87,
      "end_seconds": 127.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.58,
      "end_seconds": 133.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.98,
      "end_seconds": 136.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.77,
      "end_seconds": 140.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Okay, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.25,
      "end_seconds": 142.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.23,
      "end_seconds": 153.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.34,
      "end_seconds": 171.09,
      "duration_seconds": 16.75,
      "text": "Yes, low haemoglobin. I did try to ignore it for a while. I just want to get back to normal, really. I have high blood pressure. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.07,
      "end_seconds": 174.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "I see. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.52,
      "end_seconds": 177.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.84,
      "end_seconds": 182.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.62,
      "end_seconds": 184.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.16,
      "end_seconds": 204.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.1,
      "end_seconds": 209.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.4,
      "end_seconds": 213.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.05,
      "end_seconds": 214.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.62,
      "end_seconds": 217.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.13,
      "end_seconds": 239.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Your pulse is slow, about fifty-six, and the thyroid isn't enlarged."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.56,
      "end_seconds": 241.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.53,
      "end_seconds": 245.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.55,
      "end_seconds": 264.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Reflexes are a bit slow to relax."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.49,
      "end_seconds": 266.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.9,
      "end_seconds": 280.44,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.24,
      "end_seconds": 283.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.31,
      "end_seconds": 285.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.15,
      "end_seconds": 307.51,
      "duration_seconds": 12.36,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with an underactive thyroid at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.07,
      "end_seconds": 309.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.54,
      "end_seconds": 326.62,
      "duration_seconds": 15.08,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an underactive thyroid, and we'll know more once the a thyroid test is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling cold all the time, and no hair loss or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.21,
      "end_seconds": 329.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Well, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.22,
      "end_seconds": 334.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.63,
      "end_seconds": 335.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.39,
      "end_seconds": 352.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. I'm going to order a thyroid test, for hypothyroid symptoms. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.68,
      "end_seconds": 355.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.75,
      "end_seconds": 377.79,
      "duration_seconds": 22.04,
      "text": "I'll start you on levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach, until we review. It's for hypothyroidism. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Take the thyroid tablet on an empty stomach, half an hour before breakfast, and not with calcium or iron. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.58,
      "end_seconds": 385.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.71,
      "end_seconds": 389.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "So, uh, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.78,
      "end_seconds": 398.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Come back after the results are back. So, I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.29,
      "end_seconds": 413.22,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "So, uh, I take the levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.24,
      "end_seconds": 418.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 419.89,
      "end_seconds": 423.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}